JJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM4NF0)\n- getEmail Northbeam schedule change (WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwMl0)\n- getEmail Kenji Japanese (WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5M10)\n\nAlso check sent folder to see if there''s a reply to Kenji. Let me do that too: listEmails sent limit 20.\n\nWait — but the flight is Nov 9 which is next Monday, outside \"this week\" but still imminent. The user asks about mailboxes, so mail focus.\n\nLet me run these calls."}],"createdAt":1795579772917},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM4NF0","from":"Northbeam Air","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Your booking is confirmed: Lisbon to Tokyo, November 9","date":"Thu Sep 03 2026 21:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Booking reference NB7Q4K Passenger: Ana Silva NB 412 Lisbon (LIS) 10:25 Frankfurt (FRA) 14:20 Mon, 9 Nov 2026 NB 908 Frankfurt (FRA) 17:55 Tokyo Haneda (HND) 13:40 +1 Mon, 9 Nov 2026 Total paid: JPY 214,600 Manage your booking"},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210e4-d43a-78ab-9160-1def4c54743c_0","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM4NF0","mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1795579772944},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwMl0","from":"Northbeam Air","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Schedule change for booking NB7Q4K","date":"Thu Sep 17 2026 06:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Ana Silva,\r\n\r\nFlight NB 908 from Frankfurt to Tokyo Haneda on 9 Nov 2026 now departs at 18:30\r\nand arrives at 14:15 the next day. Your seat 14C is unchanged.\r\n\r\nNorthbeam Air"},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210e4-d43a-78ab-9160-1def4c54743c_1","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwMl0","mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1795579772945},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","res