 sent-at. The previous turn was Nov 6; now it''s Nov 25.\n\nSo things have shifted: the flight was Monday Nov 9 — that''s now in the past (16 days ago). The launch venue date Nov 26 is TOMORROW. That changes urgency dramatically.\n\nWait — is this a deliberate test? The turn sent-at is 2026-11-25T04:10:08.568Z. Yes, 19 days after the prior turn. So relative urgency must be recomputed: the Aozora launch at Harbour Hall is 26 Nov 2026 = tomorrow. That is the most urgent.\n\nBut I should verify freshness — has new mail arrived? It''s a new turn, 19 days later. Mail may have arrived. I should check the inbox again before answering, since my previous conclusions were based on Nov 6 state. Also calendar events around now.\n\nLet me re-check: aggregateInbox and listEvents for the next few days (Nov 25 – Dec 1), and maybe check whether the venue draft was sent (drafts folder) and sent folder newest.\n\nGiven \"which of those is the most urgent\" — I need current facts. Let me do a quick refresh: listEmails inbox (limit 10), listEmails sent (limit 5), listEmails drafts, listEvents Nov 24 – Dec 2.\n\nBut wait, could the whole mailbox still be stale? Let''s check.\n\nAlso the calendar: check around Nov 26 for the launch event.\n\nLet me run parallel calls."}],"createdAt":1795579814001},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","count":10,"nextPageToken":"406","emails":[{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQxNV0","threadId":"<1yyu9x3zlnnu3ni6@kestrelsupply.com>","from":"Kestrel Supply Co.","subject":"This week at the shop","date":"Sat Sep 26 2026 08:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQxNF0","threadId":"<9gjwjjdzcm5nb1e@konkanbank.in>","from":"Konkan Bank","subject":"INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Fri Sep 25 2026 04:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIs