INSERT INTO "mastra_messages" ("id","thread_id","content","role","type","createdAt","resourceId") VALUES ('53bd83e0-83d9-414a-b952-168e8d555a06','c2466a74-8c9b-4ece-8e7e-969a549399a5','{"format":2,"parts":[{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"The user wants calendar items related to the rebrand. Search calendars with query \"rebrand\" across all calendars, over a wide window. Use listEvents with query \"rebrand\" and a broad range.\n\nWhat range? The rebrand started 5 Oct 2026, kickoff mentioned. Let''s search broad: 2026-01-01 to 2027-01-01 with query \"rebrand\". Also maybe query \"Aozora\" since the rebrand is Aozora. Let''s do both: query \"rebrand\" and query \"Aozora\", maybe \"review\".\n\nlistEvents returns max 250. Let''s run two calls in parallel: query \"rebrand\" and query \"Aozora\" over 2026-01-01 to 2027-06-30.\n\nNote the bulk calendar has noise titled \"Bulk N ... review/draft/launch\" — query \"rebrand\" shouldn''t match those. \"Aozora\" won''t match bulk either.\n\nAlso consider \"review\" — there''s \"Rebrand review\" invitation from Raj dated Thu Oct 8, and \"Aozora logo review\" Oct 1, \"Aozora packaging call\" Oct 15, \"Aozora review agenda\". Query \"Aozora\" would catch those. Let''s do \"rebrand\" and \"Aozora\".","details":[{"type":"text","text":"The user wants calendar items related to the rebrand. Search calendars with query \"rebrand\" across all calendars, over a wide window. Use listEvents with query \"rebrand\" and a broad range.\n\nWhat range? The rebrand started 5 Oct 2026, kickoff mentioned. Let''s search broad: 2026-01-01 to 2027-01-01 with query \"rebrand\". Also maybe query \"Aozora\" since the rebrand is Aozora. Let''s do both: query \"rebrand\" and query \"Aozora\", maybe \"review\".\n\nlistEvents returns max 250. Let''s run two calls in parallel: query \"rebrand\" and query \"Aozora\" over 2026-01-01 to 2027-06-30.\n\nNote the bulk calendar has noise titled \"Bulk N ... review/draft/launch\" — query \"rebrand\" shouldn''t match those. \"Aozora\" won''t match bulk either.\n\nAlso consider \"review\" — there''s \"Rebrand review\" invitation from Raj dated Thu Oct 8, and \"Aozora logo review\" Oct 1, \"Aozora packaging call\" Oct 15, \"Aozora review agenda\". Query \"Aozora\" would catch those. Let''s do \"rebrand\" and \"Aozora\"."}],"createdAt":1795579833210},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":1,"events":[{"eventId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/aozora-kickoff.ics","calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/","calendarName":"Work","title":"Aozora rebrand kickoff","start":"2026-10-05T10:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T11:30:00.000Z","allDay":false,"location":"https://linkroom.app/r/aozora-kickoff","attendees":["ana@demo.trymetis.email","tomas@demo.trymetis.email","kenji@aozora-ceramics.jp"]}]},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210e5-dce3-7c67-91de-8b01b19e767c_0","toolName":"listEvents","args":{"query":"rebrand","timeMax":"2027-06-30T00:00:00Z","timeMin":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"}},"updatedAt":1795579835166},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":3,"events":[{"eventId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/aozora-logo-review.ics","calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/","calendarName":"Work","title":"Aozora logo review (internal)","start":"2026-10-01T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T15:00:00.000Z","allDay":false,"location":"Studio 2","attendees":["ana@demo.trymetis.email","tomas@demo.trymetis.email"]},{"eventId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/aozora-kickoff.ics","calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/work/","calendarName":"Work","title":"Aozora rebrand kickoff","start":"2026-10-05T10:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T11:30:00.000Z","allDay":false,"location":"https://linkroom.app/r/aozora-kickoff","attendees":["ana@demo.trymetis.email","tomas@demo.trymetis.email","kenji@aozora-ceramics.jp"]},{"eventId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/personal/tokyo-trip.ics","calendarAccountId":"ef21568e-53a9-597d-bc5c-451f8029a9de","accountEmail":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","calendarId":"http://caldav.localhost:5232/ana/personal/","calendarName":"Personal","title":"Tokyo trip","start":"2026-11-09","end":"2026-11-15","allDay":true,"attendees":[]}]},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210e5-dce3-7c67-91de-8b01b19e767c_1","toolName":"listEvents","args":{"query":"Aozora","timeMax":"2027-06-30T00:00:00Z","timeMin":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"}},"updatedAt":1795579835167},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1795579835168,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/metis/demo"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"Report. Also note the emails referencing \"Rebrand review @ Thu Oct 8\" — that event may exist? Query \"rebrand\" only returned the kickoff. Hmm, the Rebrand review Oct 8 invitation exists in mail but not on the calendar — which means it may not have been accepted / not in these calendars. That''s a notable gap worth flagging: the Oct 8 rebrand review that Raj invited you to isn''t on any visible calendar.\n\nCareful: query search may only match titles; an event titled \"Rebrand review\" would match \"rebrand\". It didn''t appear. So it''s not on any visible calendar (Work, Personal, Bulk, Edge). Worth stating: the 8 Oct review from Raj''s invitation has no matching event on your calendars — either it was declined or never landed.\n\nAlso no future rebrand events at all — nothing after 5 Oct.\n\nAnswer concisely.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"Report. Also note the emails referencing \"Rebrand review @ Thu Oct 8\" — that event may exist? Query \"rebrand\" only returned the kickoff. Hmm, the Rebrand review Oct 8 invitation exists in mail but not on the calendar — which means it may not have been accepted / not in these calendars. That''s a notable gap worth flagging: the Oct 8 rebrand review that Raj invited you to isn''t on any visible calendar.\n\nCareful: query search may only match titles; an event titled \"Rebrand review\" would match \"rebrand\". It didn''t appear. So it''s not on any visible calendar (Work, Personal, Bulk, Edge). Worth stating: the 8 Oct review from Raj''s invitation has no matching event on your calendars — either it was declined or never landed.\n\nAlso no future rebrand events at all — nothing after 5 Oct.\n\nAnswer concisely."}],"createdAt":1795579840543},{"type":"text","text":"Yes — three, all on your **Work** calendar (ana@demo.trymetis.email), and all in the past:\n\n| When (UTC) | Event | Where | Attendees |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Wed 1 Oct 2026, 14:00–15:00 | **Aozora logo review (internal)** | Studio 2 | you, Tomás |\n| Mon 5 Oct 2026, 10:00–11:30 | **Aozora rebrand kickoff** | Linkroom — linkroom.app/r/aozora-kickoff | you, Tomás, kenji@aozora-ceramics.jp |\n\nThe kickoff lands exactly on the **5 Oct** start date Raj named in the kickoff email, and it already has Kenji on it — so the \"can Tomás join the first review?\" question resolved itself in the calendar. Your **Tokyo trip** (all-day, 9–15 Nov) on the Personal calendar is the only Aozora-adjacent thing besides these.\n\nTwo gaps worth knowing:\n\n- The **\"Rebrand review\" Raj invited you to for Thu 8 Oct 15:00 UTC** (in your inbox from 24 Sep) does **not** appear on any of your four calendars. Either you never accepted it, or it was declined — the mailbox has no reply from you.\n- There is **nothing rebrand-related scheduled after 5 Oct** — no follow-up review, no launch prep, nothing pointing at the 26 Nov Harbour Hall date.","createdAt":1795579840543}],"metadata":{"modelId":"metis/demo","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"Yes — three, all on your **Work** calendar (ana@demo.trymetis.email), and all in the past:\n\n| When (UTC) | Event | Where | Attendees |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Wed 1 Oct 2026, 14:00–15:00 | **Aozora logo review (internal)** | Studio 2 | you, Tomás |\n| Mon 5 Oct 2026, 10:00–11:30 | **Aozora rebrand kickoff** | Linkroom — linkroom.app/r/aozora-kickoff | you, Tomás, kenji@aozora-ceramics.jp |\n\nThe kickoff lands exactly on the **5 Oct** start date Raj named in the kickoff email, and it already has Kenji on it — so the \"can Tomás join the first review?\" question resolved itself in the calendar. Your **Tokyo trip** (all-day, 9–15 Nov) on the Personal calendar is the only Aozora-adjacent thing besides these.\n\nTwo gaps worth knowing:\n\n- The **\"Rebrand review\" Raj invited you to for Thu 8 Oct 15:00 UTC** (in your inbox from 24 Sep) does **not** appear on any of your four calendars. Either you never accepted it, or it was declined — the mailbox has no reply from you.\n- There is **nothing rebrand-related scheduled after 5 Oct** — no follow-up review, no launch prep, nothing pointing at the 26 Nov Harbour Hall date."}','assistant','v2','2026-11-25T04:10:33.210Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
