pected details? Not needed much.\n\nLet me list spam and trash (limit 25 each).\n\nAlso there''s \"Your Swiftpost parcel is delayed\" from Apr 20 2026 — that''s for the A-31 April order (delivered 24 Apr). Not A-42.\n\nInteresting: tracking number SP4471920385PT appears in only 2 emails (the shipped email and the Aug out-for-delivery?). Wait, the SP4471920385PT search returned the Aug 4 \"out for delivery today\" email too. That''s odd — that Aug email presumably references a different tracking number? Actually the search matched it maybe because of content... Hmm, the search index may match loosely. Or maybe the Aug 4 out-for-delivery email actually does contain SP4471920385PT? That would be strange. Let me read that Aug 4 email raw to see its tracking number — it matters: if the Aug delivery email carries the A-42 tracking number, that would be inconsistent (A-42 ordered 18 Sep).\n\nLet''s check: getRawEmail for WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM2NF0 (Aug 4 out for delivery). And list spam/trash.\n\nAlso check whether the Apr 20 delayed email relates. Let me do: listEmails spam, listEmails trash, getRawEmail Aug4.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"Now check spam/trash for a delivery notification for SP4471920385PT. Let me list emails in spam and trash of that mailbox. Also check the A-42 order confirmation email for expected details? Not needed much.\n\nLet me list spam and trash (limit 25 each).\n\nAlso there''s \"Your Swiftpost parcel is delayed\" from Apr 20 2026 — that''s for the A-31 April order (delivered 24 Apr). Not A-42.\n\nInteresting: tracking number SP4471920385PT appears in only 2 emails (the shipped email and the Aug out-for-delivery?). Wait, the SP4471920385PT search returned the Aug 4 \"out for delivery today\" email too. That''s odd — that Aug email presumably references a different tracking number? Actually the search matched it maybe because of content... Hmm, the search index may match loosely. Or maybe the Aug 4 out-for-delivery email actually does contain SP4471920385PT? That would be strange. Let me read that Aug 4 email raw to see its tracking number — it matters: if the Aug delivery email carries the A-42 tracking number, that would be inconsistent (A-42 ordered 18 Sep).\n\nLet''s check: getRawEmail for WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM2NF0 (Aug 4 out for delivery). And list spam/trash.\n\nAlso check whether the Apr 20 delayed email relates. Let me do: listEmails spam, listEmails trash, getRawEmail Aug4."}],"createdAt":1795579940607},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM2NF0","truncated":false,"raw":"From: Swiftpost <tracking@swiftpost.com>\r\nTo: Ana Silva <ana@demo.trymetis.email>\r\nSubject: Your parcel is out for delivery today\r\nDate: Tue, 04 Aug 2026 06:30:00 +0000\r\nMessage-ID: <53htewr39sp2gwub@swiftpost.com>\r\nAuto-Submitted: auto-generated\r\nMIME-Version: 1.0\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\r\n\r\n<html><body>\r\n<p>Parcel SP4471920385PT for Brightloom order A-38: <strong>out for delivery</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Your driver will arrive between 10:00 and 13:00.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://swiftpost.com/track/SP4471920385PT\">Track your parcel</a></p>\r\n</body></html>"},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210e7-6f23-7765-b176-9d53a9aa817d_0","toolName":"getRawEmail","args":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM2NF0","mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1795579940622},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","count":10,"nextPageToken":"3","emails":[{"id":"WyJKdW5rIiwiMTAwMCIsMTJd","threadId":"<1r6ojk2y7eiac382@konkan-bank-secure.com>","from":"Konkan Bank","subject":"Action required: your account **4821 is suspended","date":"Tue Sep 15 2026 03:12:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":false,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJKdW5rIiwiMTAwMCIsMTFd","threadId":"<2x