teness I might call listMailboxes. It''s cheap. Let me do it.\n\nAlso search \"invoice\" and \"receipt\" and \"charged\".\n\nLet''s fetch details: getRawEmail 414 (25 Sep 1250), 396 (12 Sep 450), 363 (2 Aug 2760), and 334 (8 Jun 980)? Probably just summarize amounts; details of merchant matter. Let''s read the three recent ones plus the 17 Apr/Apr 29 pair? \"Lately\" — focus on recent months: 25 Sep, 12 Sep, 2 Aug, 8 Jun. Reading raws gives merchant names.\n\nDo parallel: getRaw 414, 396, 363, 334, listMailboxes, searchMail \"invoice\"."}],"createdAt":1795579977777},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQxNF0","truncated":false,"raw":"From: Konkan Bank <alerts@konkanbank.in>\r\nTo: Ana Silva <ana@demo.trymetis.email>\r\nSubject: INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821\r\nDate: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:10:00 +0000\r\nMessage-ID: <9gjwjjdzcm5nb1e@konkanbank.in>\r\nAuto-Submitted: auto-generated\r\nMIME-Version: 1.0\r\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\r\n\r\nDear Customer, INR 1250.00 has been debited from account **4821 to\r\nVPA chaiwala.store@konkan on 25-09-26. UPI Ref 427311009876.\r\nAvailable balance: INR 48,210.55.\r\nNot you? Call 1800 266 4821 to block your account."},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210e8-05d5-7bb2-968f-28a287da829e_0","toolName":"getRawEmail","args":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQxNF0","mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1795579978252},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5Nl0","truncated":false,"raw":"From: Konkan Bank <alerts@konkanbank.in>\r\nTo: Ana Silva <ana@demo.trymetis.email>\r\nSubject: INR 450.00 debited from a/c **4821\r\nDate: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 06:55:00 +0000\r\nMessage-ID: <3fznychsgq07fldj@konkanbank.in>\r\nAuto-Submitted: auto-generated\r\nMIME-Vers