56 items which look like mostly Kestrel.\n\nLet me count the Kestrel \"This week...\" in the \"digest\"/other searches. In the \"This week at Kestrel\" search (count 55) the list I received appears to include items from Sep 18 2026 back to Nov 07 2024. Let me count that list: I''ll enumerate from the third result (query \"This week at Kestrel\"):\n\n1 Sep 18 2026 (404)\n2 Sep 08 (390)\n3 Aug 29 (376)\n4 Aug 19 (372)\n5 Aug 09 (366)\n6 Jul 30 (359)\n7 Jul 20 (353)\n8 Jul 10 (349)\n9 Jun 30 (342)\n10 Jun 20 (336)\n11 Jun 10 (335)\n12 May 31 (329)\n13 May 21 (327)\n14 May 11 (325)\n15 May 01 (323)\n16 Apr 11 (315)\n17 Apr 01 (80)\n18 Mar 22 (312)\n19 Mar 02 (310)\n20 Feb 20 (70)\n21 Feb 10 (309)\n22 Jan 21 (307)\n23 Jan 11 (63)\n24 Jan 01 (305)\n25 Dec 12 2025 (304)\n26 Dec 02 (54)\n27 Nov 22 (303)\n28 Nov 02 (302)\n29 Oct 23 (47)\n30 Oct 13 (301)\n31 Sep 23 2025 (300)\n32 Sep 13 (39)\n33 Sep 03 (299)\n34 Aug 14 (298)\n35 Aug 04 (33)\n36 Jul 25 (297)\n37 Jul 05 (296)\n38 Jun 25 (29)\n39 Jun 15 (295)\n40 May 26 (294)\n41 May 16 (23)\n42 May 06 (293)\n43 Apr 16 (292)\n44 Apr 06 (20)\n45 Mar 27 (291)\n46 Mar 07 (290)\n47 Feb 25 (13)\n48 Feb 15 (289)\n49 Jan 26 (288)\n50 Jan 16 (8)\n51 Jan 06 2025 (287)\n52 Dec 17 2024 (286)\n53 Dec 07 2024 (4)\n54 Nov 27 2024 (285)\n55 Nov 07 2024 (284)\n\nThat''s 55 — matches count 55. \n\nSo Kestrel \"This week at Kestrel\" series = 55 messages (Nov 2024 – Sep 2026), roughly twice a month. Plus 2 extra Kestrel promos: \"This week at the shop\" (26 Sep 2026, id 415) and \"15% off this weekend only\" (11 Aug 2026, 371), \"Spring sale starts now\" (20 Mar 2026, 311), \"Black Friday: 25% off stoneware\" (27 Nov 2025 in trash — id 15 trashed).\n\nNote: \"This week at the shop\" is a separate subject — maybe a rebrand. Also there''s a Kestrel email in trash: Black Friday 25% off (27 Nov 2025).\n\nCodeyard \"Your weekly Codeyard digest\": from \"digest\" search — 6 shown: Sep 7, Aug 24, Jul 27, Jun 29, Jun 1. That''s 5 items + Paperstack ones.