al.\n\nKestrel emails also in trash: \"This week at Kestrel: Workshop: kintsugi basics\", \"Linen, washed and ready\" (2 trashed).\n\nAlso Codeyard weekly digests — no unsubscribes.\n\nTotal picture: Let me give counts:\n- Kestrel \"This week at Kestrel\" — 55, Nov 2024 → Sep 2026, ~2/month. Plus \"This week at the shop\" (26 Sep 2026) which appears to be the relaunch after a 8-day gap.\n- Kestrel promotional: \"15% off this weekend only\" (11 Aug 2026), \"Spring sale starts now\" (20 Mar 2026), \"Black Friday: 25% off stoneware\" (27 Nov 2025, in trash).\n- Codeyard weekly digest — 5 (1 Jun – 7 Sep 2026).\n- Paperstack month — 6 (Nov 2025 – Sep 2026).\n- Priya''s \"[Fernhill Team] Studio weekly\" — 10 (Jan 2025 – Sep 2026) — internal.\n- Linkroom product announcements — 4.\n- Northbeam Air promotional — 2.\n- One unsubscribe confirmation (Tavola picks, 7 Mar 2026).\n\nAlso worth noting: the newsletter label exists but is unused/nullable — I can''t query by label, so this is content-based. Actually can I tell if any email has the newsletter label? No label info in results. I should not claim.\n\nAlso note Kestrel''s cadence gap: last \"This week at Kestrel\" 18 Sep 2026, then \"This week at the shop\" 26 Sep 2026, then nothing since (2 months). Worth pointing out.\n\nAlso \"This week at Kestrel\" content repeats: only 5 distinct subject lines cycling (candle edit, stoneware from Porto, gifts under EUR 30, a kitchen for slow mornings, meet the maker: Oficina Lume, linen washed and ready, notebooks, workshop kintsugi). Note that 55 emails across ~8 topics.\n\nExcluded as transactional (not newsletters): Konkan Bank alerts/statements, Ledgerline invoices & login codes, Swiftpost tracking, Brightloom orders, Voltaro bills/payment receipts, Paperstack sign-in link, Codeyard PR/build/sign-in, Linkroom renewal notice, Northbeam booking confirmations, calendar invitations.\n\nLet me give the answer, with the tip that the built-in `newsletter` label exists and could be appli