icina Lume`, `Linen, washed and ready`, `Notebooks for the new year`, `Workshop: kintsugi basics`), so it''s the same shop window reopening twice a month for two years.\n2. **The Kestrel series has gone quiet.** 18 Sep → `This week at the shop` on 26 Sep → nothing for two months. Either a list migration or you''ve been dropped/pruned.\n3. **Not everything regular is a newsletter.** I excluded these transactional streams: Konkan Bank alerts and statements, Ledgerline invoices and login codes, Swiftpost tracking, Brightloom order mail, Voltaro Energy bills, Codeyard PR/build/sign-in notices, Linkroom and Paperstack renewal and sign-in mail, Northbeam booking confirmations, calendar invitations.\n\nWant me to label these `newsletter` so the classification sticks? It''s a bulk write across 76 messages and will come to you for approval first — and I''d leave Priya''s `Studio weekly` unlabelled unless you say otherwise."}','assistant','v2','2026-11-25T04:14:33.616Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
