on: read welcome.txt on 3 drives to confirm identical content. That''s a quick check and makes the claim solid. Also check Saffron & Sage folder? Probably fine.\n\nLet me load readFile and read welcome.txt on two/three drives."}],"createdAt":1795580188300},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"results":[{"name":"getFileText","description":"Read the contents of a plain-text file in a drive — notes, markdown, CSV, JSON, source code or config. Only works on text files; use getFile for an...","score":16.65},{"name":"getAttachmentText","description":"Read an email attachment as text: PDFs, calendar invites, contact cards, wallet passes and forwarded emails come back as extracted data, plain-text...","score":8.68},{"name":"renameFile","description":"Rename a file or folder in a drive.","score":6.41},{"name":"deleteFile","description":"Delete a file or folder from a drive. Google Drive and OneDrive move it to their own trash; S3, WebDAV, FTP and SFTP delete it outright.","score":5.28},{"name":"moveFile","description":"Move a file or folder into another folder of the same drive, or to its top level when parentFolderId is omitted. Files cannot be moved between drives.","score":5.19}],"loaded":["getFileText","getAttachmentText","renameFile","deleteFile","moveFile"],"message":"Found and loaded 5 tool(s): getFileText, getAttachmentText, renameFile, deleteFile, moveFile. They are available on your next turn — call them directly. Some were already loaded."},"toolCallId":"call_resp_01a210eb-46ab-785e-abbd-533fe06fe1b0_0","toolName":"search_tools","args":{"query":"read file text contents"}},"updatedAt":1795580188302},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1795580188306,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/metis/demo"},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"fileId":"welcome.txt","name":"welcome.txt","truncated":false,"text":"Welcome to the Fernhill Studio shared drive.\n\nClient work lives under Clients/, invoices and budgets u