er-member access control to reason about — but several things *behave* as though there were a team. The drive''s own `welcome.txt` says \"Ask Sam for access to `Finance/`\", Priya sends a `[Fernhill Team] Studio weekly`, and Raj owns the Aozora calendar invitations. Those people exist as email contacts and calendar organisers, not as workspace members — which is why they can''t be found in this list.\n\nIf you expected colleagues in here, I can check **pending invitations** to see whether anyone was invited but never joined."}','assistant','v2','2026-11-25T04:17:11.586Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
